 1-2 Tech Debt & Security Audit completada\n\nTAREAS COMPLETADAS:\n1. Logging seguro con sanitización PII (8 patrones)\n   - Frontend: public/js/logger-manager.js\n   - Backend: backend/utils/devLogger.js\n   - Sanitiza: JWT, Email, Password, Phone, CURP, CC\n\n2. Índices de BD complementarios (50 adicionales)\n   - backend/scripts/create-indexes-complementary-2025-12.sql\n   - 18 tablas cubiertas (library, iacoins, polls, newsletters, etc.)\n\n3. Auditoría de Seguridad OWASP Top 10\n   - docs/SECURITY-AUDIT-OWASP-2025-12-18.md\n   - Puntuación: 72/100 (Aceptable)\n   - Hallazgos: CSP unsafe-inline, 32 SQL injection, 878 XSS potenciales\n\n4. Documentación de auditoría exhaustiva\n   - AUDITORIA_EXHAUSTIVA_2025.md (Plan 52 semanas)\n   - LISTA_COMPLETA_FORMULARIOS.md (33 formularios)\n\nMÉTRICAS:\n- 4,586 console.log ahora sanitizados\n- 105 índices de BD totales\n- 10 categorías OWASP evaluadas\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"391c2f53f0d36c2f6b6e01c27fef9eecb056c500","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/391c2f53f0d36c2f6b6e01c27fef9eecb056c500"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/41fa3f5edbc8afcbf8cb44f928aea5a4e940048b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/41fa3f5edbc8afcbf8cb44f928aea5a4e940048b","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDQxZmEzZjVlZGJjOGFmY2JmOGNiNDRmOTI4YWVhNWE0ZTk0MDA0OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/782141d4c30edf0b3b2f4f29595df822d315d8b2","sha":"782141d4c30edf0b3b2f4f29595df822d315d8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/782141d4c30edf0b3b2f4f29595df822d315d8b2"}],"sha":"41fa3f5edbc8afcbf8cb44f928aea5a4e940048b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/41fa3f5edbc8af