edad correcta en API response es totalCoins, no balance\n\n4. ✅ REPARACIÓN DE BÚSQUEDA EN HEADER\n   - Agregar script search-simple.js al header\n   - Reparar datos roto en primera entrada de searchDatabase\n   - Búsqueda ahora funcional en todas las páginas\n\n📊 ESTADÍSTICAS:\n- Endpoints reparados: 5 (balance, achievements, challenges, leaderboard, transactions)\n- Endpoints creados: 3 (/api/polls, /api/polls/categories/list, /api/teachers-portal/dashboard)\n- Archivos modificados: 4\n- TypeErrors resueltos: 2 (iacoins-dashboard.js, iacoins-store.html)\n- 404 errors resueltos: 3\n\n🧠 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae7610ebc5252467f3bb32aba7146a23914f5319","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/ae7610ebc5252467f3bb32aba7146a23914f5319"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/75459e0b2a9db222eefc42a4791ce18c6dd946fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/75459e0b2a9db222eefc42a4791ce18c6dd946fb","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDc1NDU5ZTBiMmE5ZGIyMjJlZWZjNDJhNDc5MWNlMThjNmRkOTQ2ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/1bd1b8ea8c4321ebd012b8b6c1c08a510ecfa3a9","sha":"1bd1b8ea8c4321ebd012b8b6c1c08a510ecfa3a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/1bd1b8ea8c4321ebd012b8b6c1c08a510ecfa3a9"}],"sha":"75459e0b2a9db222eefc42a4791ce18c6dd946fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/75459e0b2a9db222eefc42a4791ce18c6dd946fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/1bd1b8ea8c4321ebd012b8b6c1c08a510ecfa3a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T23:42:33Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T23:42:33Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.