commit/4186003b7e1bf10dda1158552ce44c7557edfd44","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDQxODYwMDNiN2UxYmYxMGRkYTExNTg1NTJjZTQ0Yzc1NTdlZGZkNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d","sha":"d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d"}],"sha":"4186003b7e1bf10dda1158552ce44c7557edfd44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4186003b7e1bf10dda1158552ce44c7557edfd44"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:32:58Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:32:58Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(auth): Ultra-simplificada lógica de detección de éxito - confiar en HTTP 200 + user + token","tree":{"sha":"75a5086295f08a3d1f16bd97d3ecb8be702de3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/75a5086295f08a3d1f16bd97d3ecb8be702de3ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKGQxYWFjNDhhNTFhZDg5NmE5NTI4MjRiNDQ2MWFhMTIyMTE1ZGRjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d","sha":"4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d"}],"sha":"d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/d1aac48a51ad896a952824b4461aa122115ddc4d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:25:03Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:25:03Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(diagnostico): Guía de diagnóstico profundo para identificar causa exacta del login\n\nCONTENIDO:\n- Explicación del problema reportado\n- Nuevo fix ultra-defensivo implementado (commit 7e1d369)\n- Pasos exactos para capturar logs de Console (5 minutos)\n- Qué buscar en los logs para identificar causa\n- Opciones para compartir información\n\nOBJETIVO:\nCon los logs detallados, podré identificar EXACTAMENTE por qué:\n1. isSuccess = false incluso con ''Autenticación exitosa''\n2. Modal no se cierra\n3. Alerta aparece en rojo\n\nPróximo paso: Usuario ejecuta pasos y compartir logs","tree":{"sha":"647974cda27fd6ecbe8bdc7e4b77f9acb636ef0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/647974cda27fd6ecbe8bdc7e4b77f9acb636ef0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDRkZGVhMmE1ZjM4NTQzYzIwYzBjYTQyOGYzZTc1MTE0MTg4ODNlMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0","sha":"7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0"}],"sha":"4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4ddea2a5f38543c20c0ca428f3e7511418883e1d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:24:34Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:24:34Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(auth): Debug profundo y fix ultra-defensivo para detección de login exitoso\n\nPROBLEMA REPORTADO:\n- Usuario ve ''Autenticación exitosa'' en alerta ROJA (no verde)\n- Modal NO se cierra aunque dice que es exitoso\n- El fix anterior (palabras clave españolas) NO funcionó\n\nCAUSA INVESTIGADA:\n- isSuccess evaluaba como FALSE incluso con mensaje ''Autenticación exitosa''\n- Posibles causas:\n  1. Problema con encoding de caracteres (tilde en autenticación)\n  2. Estructura del mensaje diferente a lo esperado\n  3. data.error o data.success interfiriendo con la lógica\n\nCAMBIOS IMPLEMENTADOS:\n1. DEBUG PROFUNDO:\n   - Log de estructura exacta de response (keys, values)\n   - Log del mensaje con length y char codes\n   - Log de cada check individual (hasExitWord, hasAuthWord, etc)\n\n2. FIX ULTRA-DEFENSIVO:\n   - Múltiples puntos de detección de éxito\n   - Check de encoding (con/sin tilde)\n   - Fallback: si response.ok=true y sin error, ASUMIR ÉXITO\n   - Menos dependencia de campos booleanos, más en HTTP status\n\n3. LÓGICA MEJORADA:\n   OLD: messageHasSuccess || (responseOk && dataSuccess) || ...\n   NEW: (responseOk && \\!data?.error) || messageHasSuccess || dataSuccess === true\n\n   Esto significa: Si HTTP 200 y sin campo error = ÉXITO, punto.\n\nRESULTADO ESPERADO:\n- Con esta versión, veremos EXACTAMENTE qué está pasando en Console\n- Los logs mostrarán punto por punto dónde falla la detección\n- El fix ultra-defensivo debería detectar éxito en casi cualquier escenario\n\nStatus: Ready for debugging with user","tree":{"sha":"88650feb41f4af84fe80b612d2febb41b0c5bf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/88650feb41f4af84fe80b612d2febb41b0c5bf43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDdlMWQzNjk0MGZkN2YwYmMwMjA1ZTEyNzU3M2M0ODQwNmNlZjA0ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b","sha":"38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b"}],"sha":"7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/7e1d36940fd7f0bc0205e127573c48406cef04d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:17:49Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:17:49Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(fix-verification): Documentación completa del fix y pasos de verificación\n\nCONTENIDOS:\n1. FIX_INMEDIATO_NUEVA_EVIDENCIA.md: Análisis del problema y diagnóstico\n   - Explica por qué ''Autenticación exitosa'' aparecía en alerta roja\n   - 5 pasos de diagnóstico con Network tab\n   - 3 causas probables identificadas\n\n2. RESUMEN_FIX_APLICADO_15DIC.md: Documentación del fix implementado\n   - Código ANTES y DESPUÉS\n   - Explicación de mejoras\n   - Flujo completo del login post-fix\n   - Lecciones aprendidas\n\n3. VERIFICA_FIX_AHORA.md: Guía rápida para verificar que funciona\n   - 4 pasos simples (5 minutos total)\n   - Checklist de verificación\n   - Qué buscar en cada punto\n\nFIX APLICADO (Commit 38b0859):\n- Agregadas palabras clave españolas al check de éxito\n- Reordenada la lógica para confiar primero en mensaje\n- Sintaxis validada ✅\n- Ready for testing ✅\n\nStatus: Esperando que usuario verifique el fix","tree":{"sha":"ac0c35d9c632c62b7156a4eabc034aca56074506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/ac0c35d9c632c62b7156a4eabc034aca56074506"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDM4NDQ5Y2JhYjA5OGIyMzViMmYzNDgwZmI3MWI0NzRiZDAzMGYyMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d","sha":"38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d"}],"sha":"38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38449cbab098b235b2f3480fb71b474bd030f21b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:16:49Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T07:16:49Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(auth): Mejorar detección de login exitoso para mensajes en español\n\nPROBLEMA ENCONTRADO:\n- Usuario ve ''Autenticación exitosa'' pero en alerta ROJA (error)\n- El backend responde correctamente pero frontend lo clasifica como error\n- Causa: El check de mensaje no detectaba palabras españolas\n\nCAMBIOS:\n- Agregados checks para palabras clave españolas: ''autenticaci'', ''bienvenid'', ''correct''\n- Reordenado la lógica de éxito: ahora check de mensaje es PRIMERO (más fiable)\n- Fallback a status/success flag como secondary check\n\nRESULTADO ESPERADO:\n✅ Login con ''Autenticación exitosa'' ahora se detecta como ÉXITO\n✅ Modal se cierra\n✅ Sesión se guarda\n✅ Header se actualiza con nombre del usuario\n\nLines modified: 1529-1540 en unified-auth-system-v2.js\nValidation: ✅ Sintaxis JavaScript correcta","tree":{"sha":"0d7129cc104c6469c0b84eaa10eb2ac6523d3f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/0d7129cc104c6469c0b84eaa10eb2ac6523d3f68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDM4YjA4NTkzYWZlMDJjZjAwODdhZjg2MzVmMjk2M2RkYTAyMDgyNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744","sha":"2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744"}],"sha":"38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/38b08593afe02cf0087af8635f2963dda020824d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:55:54Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:55:54Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(diagnostico): Investigación completa de problemas de login y persistencia de sesión\n\nSe han identificado 3 problemas críticos:\n1. Sesión NO se persiste después del login (ROOT CAUSE)\n2. Header NO muestra nombre del usuario (race condition en updateAuthUI)\n3. Usuario redirigido de iacoins-dashboard a index (consecuencia de #1)\n\nSe crearon 4 documentos detallados:\n- DIAGNOSTICO_PROBLEMAS_LOGIN_DEFINITIVO.md: Análisis de causas raíz\n- ACCIONES_INMEDIATAS_USUARIO.md: Guía de 15 minutos para diagnosticar\n- ANALISIS_TECNICO_FLUJO_LOGIN.md: Flujo técnico completo con código\n- RESUMEN_INVESTIGACION_LOGIN.md: Resumen ejecutivo\n\nHallazgos:\n- Código parece correcto en estructura\n- 4 puntos posibles de fallo identificados\n- Herramientas de debugging (DEBUG_LOGIN_SESSION.js) disponibles\n- Próximos pasos claros para el usuario\n\n🔍 Investigación: COMPLETADA\n⏳ Siguiente: Esperar resultados de tests del usuario","tree":{"sha":"2c307f2dccb58c8da8298291e2aa4fbff14bc4fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/2c307f2dccb58c8da8298291e2aa4fbff14bc4fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDJkMjUxNGZjMTM4ZTE2MzhjNGU2ZDE0MzI3OGIyMjk2M2IwOTg3NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca","sha":"ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca"}],"sha":"2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2d2514fc138e1638c4e6d143278b22963b098744"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:50:04Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:50:04Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"debug: Scripts y instrucciones para diagnosticar problema real de persistencia de sesión\n\n- DEBUG_LOGIN_SESSION.js: Script interactivo con funciones de test\n- PRUEBAS_REALES_LOGIN_15DIC.md: Instrucciones paso a paso para usuario\n- Objetivo: Identificar por qué login NO persiste sesión\n- Problema reportado: usuario puede loguearse, pero sesión no se guarda, por eso redirige a index al intentar acceder a dashboard IA\n\nNecesito que usuario ejecute estas pruebas en Console (F12) para capturar los logs exactos.","tree":{"sha":"5d0d40d00af4db8badbd249c2385f822aae07df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/5d0d40d00af4db8badbd249c2385f822aae07df3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKGJhNjhmODI1YWFkNTYwZWFiZGJjNmFiMTkwMDhhNTM4MDUxZGQ1Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/0a30581b2f94fe594718fd4a16e424a8c220eb71","sha":"0a30581b2f94fe594718fd4a16e424a8c220eb71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0a30581b2f94fe594718fd4a16e424a8c220eb71"}],"sha":"ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/ba68f825aad560eabdbc6ab19008a538051dd5ca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0a30581b2f94fe594718fd4a16e424a8c220eb71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:20:24Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:20:24Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(summary): Resumen completo de sesión - Fixes de login completados","tree":{"sha":"ba319197e2a0435c1f5dac15d66d3947ba899105","url":"https://api.github.com/