Sin alert, mostrar 0.00 si no está logueado\n\nTesting:\n✅ Página carga sin alerts de login\n✅ Balance muestra correctamente\n✅ Emojis muestran sin corrupción\n✅ Console sin errores críticos\n✅ Packages se renderizan correctamente\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2615d3c264fc5c7278cdb236fbd9978d34684a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/2615d3c264fc5c7278cdb236fbd9978d34684a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/0a027badbc87c46a74e90eda5d07b204e9f11520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/0a027badbc87c46a74e90eda5d07b204e9f11520","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDBhMDI3YmFkYmM4N2M0NmE3NGU5MGVkYTVkMDdiMjA0ZTlmMTE1MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0","sha":"4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0"}],"sha":"0a027badbc87c46a74e90eda5d07b204e9f11520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0a027badbc87c46a74e90eda5d07b204e9f11520"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T16:01:03Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T16:01:03Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(iacoins): Informe final completo de debugging session\n\nDocumento exhaustivo que incluye:\n- Resumen ejecutivo del proyecto\n- Problemas identificados y soluciones implementadas\n- Análisis root cause de cada error\n- Detalles técnicos de cambios en código\n- Testing realizado y resultados\n- Métricas finales\n- Próximos pasos opcionales\n\nStatus: ✅ COMPLETADO - Dashboard operacional 100%\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f95f8998ba90be7595c46c3f983f9e8d01eb7c9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/f95f8998ba90be7595c46c3f983f9e8d01eb7c9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDQxMDlhMDY4MmVkZWYwYjA4MWM4YTY5NTFlZGY4ZTRiZWEyZGQwZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2","sha":"2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2"}],"sha":"4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/4109a0682edef0b081c8a6951edf8e4bea2dd0d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T16:00:13Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T16:00:13Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(iacoins): Agregué helper executeQuery y corregí TypeError\n\nProblema crítico encontrado y resuelto:\n- executeQuery no era importado/exportado desde database-access.js\n- Endpoints fallaban con: TypeError: executeQuery is not a function\n- Solución: Crear helper function que usa getPool() y pg.Client\n\nCambios:\n1. Agregó helper executeQuery() en iacoins.js (líneas 22-34)\n   - Obtiene connection pool de database-access.js\n   - Ejecuta queries y retorna rows\n   - Manejo correcto de release()\n\n2. Todos los 5 endpoints ahora funcionan:\n   ✅ GET /api/iacoins/balance\n   ✅ GET /api/iacoins/transactions\n   ✅ GET /api/iacoins/challenges\n   ✅ GET /api/iacoins/achievements\n   ✅ GET /api/iacoins/leaderboard\n\n3. Dashboard funciona 100%:\n   ✅ Datos cargados desde BD (real data, no demo)\n   ✅ Sin spinners infinitos\n   ✅ Console sin errores\n   ✅ Leaderboard muestra 5 usuarios\n   ✅ Transacciones históricas visibles\n\nStatus: ✅ COMPLETADO Y VALIDADO EN NAVEGADOR\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29f7973c40d8bb09ef7cee47724f626de1363729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/29f7973c40d8bb09ef7cee47724f626de1363729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDI2MDNkYTJlZDk4YTA0ZTQ0Y2EzZWQ5MTZlMmYzMWQ2YzI2ZTJlZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/32aa3e054213c5f0e20489410086a95e198b4124","sha":"32aa3e054213c5f0e20489410086a95e198b4124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/32aa3e054213c5f0e20489410086a95e198b4124"}],"sha":"2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2603da2ed98a04e44ca3ed916e2f31d6c26e2ef2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/32aa3e054213c5f0e20489410086a95e198b4124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T15:56:10Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T15:56:10Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(iacoins): Corregir scope de variables limit/