atus\n- Real-time metrics tracking per tenant","tree":{"sha":"07ff19c96cfd548dd79e36c9d53ee4f75dbcd3fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/07ff19c96cfd548dd79e36c9d53ee4f75dbcd3fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/c4d98eaced5f8192f29b21b70c29b0712dc4b804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/c4d98eaced5f8192f29b21b70c29b0712dc4b804","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKGM0ZDk4ZWFjZWQ1ZjgxOTJmMjliMjFiNzBjMjliMDcxMmRjNGI4MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/8b4fa7e2bc5630f7b7b86a92b981b85545ca32f2","sha":"8b4fa7e2bc5630f7b7b86a92b981b85545ca32f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/8b4fa7e2bc5630f7b7b86a92b981b85545ca32f2"}],"sha":"c4d98eaced5f8192f29b21b70c29b0712dc4b804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/c4d98eaced5f8192f29b21b70c29b0712dc4b804"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/8b4fa7e2bc5630f7b7b86a92b981b85545ca32f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-07T22:04:45Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-07T22:04:45Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"feat(backend): Complete TypeScript migration Phase 4 - 54 services migrated\n\n- Migrated 41 new services to TypeScript in this session\n- Created 60 bridge files for backward compatibility\n- Total: 54 TypeScript services, 74 TypeScript DAOs\n- Generated approximately 9,600 new lines of TypeScript code\n\nServices migrated include:\n- Security: advanced-security, security-audit, two-factor\n- AI: ai-generation, ai-tutor, chatbot, predictive-analytics\n- Collaboration: realtime-collaboration, collaborative-editing, websocket\n- Gamification: challenges, levels, tournaments, forums, marketpla