ndex.html que funciona correctamente\n- Cambios:\n  * Agregado CSP meta http-equiv tag en HEAD (como en index.html)\n  * Agregado body { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; } en <style> al inicio\n  * Agregado integrity attributes a Bootstrap CSS y JS\n  * Preconnects para optimización (fonts, cdn)\n  * Font Awesome 6.5.1 (compatible con version en index.html)\n  * Padding reducido en hero: 80px → 60px\n- Resultado: Página ahora se vea igual que index.html y otras páginas\n\n🧠 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"535b219c13a6f0ed6d676b9bb9210fa9a5ccc015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/535b219c13a6f0ed6d676b9bb9210fa9a5ccc015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/7e52ae061c6f2df7c6a7f9fc1a942f4f6a6f6b1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/7e52ae061c6f2df7c6a7f9fc1a942f4f6a6f6b1a","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDdlNTJhZTA2MWM2ZjJkZjdjNmE3ZjlmYzFhOTQyZjRmNmE2ZjZiMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a","sha":"706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a"}],"sha":"7e52ae061c6f2df7c6a7f9fc1a942f4f6a6f6b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/7e52ae061c6f2df7c6a7f9fc1a942f4f6a6f6b1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-06T14:12:06Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T14:17:18Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(encuestas-fix): Documentación completa del diagnóstico y solución\n\n- Análisis detallado del problema: HTML/JS corrupto dentro de CSS (líneas 267-435)\n- Explicación de por qué causaba auto-redirección del menú\n- Solución: Reconstrucción desde cero usando index.html como plantilla\n- Comparativa antes/después con 8 aspectos clave\n- Flujo correcto de carga después del fix\n- Checklist de testing recomendado\n- Referencias a archivos estudiados y documentación\n\n🧠 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b381aff401d6cc2635ab72757963c4cd03e2c5cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/b381aff401d6cc2635ab72757963c4cd03e2c5cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDcwNmM0MmQzYmM3MjFiM2UzZTkzYTVjY2JjNGYzNGI2NjA2ODE4NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d","sha":"436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d"}],"sha":"706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/706c42d3bc721b3e3e93a5ccbc4f34b66068184a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-06T14:11:08Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T14:11:08Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(encuestas): Reconstruir completamente desde cero - Solucionar auto-redirección de menú\n\n- Problema: encuestas.html estaba completamente CORRUPTO con HTML/JS mezclado dentro de estilos CSS\n- Líneas 267-435 contenían código desordenado que causaba carga incorrecta de scripts\n- Solución: Reconstruir desde CERO usando index.html como plantilla\n- Cambios:\n  * Orden correcto de carga de scripts: HTML → CSS → JS crítico → Framework → Módulos\n  * Bootstrap JS cargado correctamente (no antes de los scripts propios)\n  * main.js cargado en HEAD con defer (para inyección dinámica de header/footer)\n  * DOMPurify cargado ANTES de scripts que lo usan\n  * Eliminadas todas las secciones duplicadas/corruptas\n  * Estructura idéntica a index.html pero con contenido específico de encuestas\n- Meta tags limpios sin HTML anidado\n- Estilos CSS en su propia sección (no mezclado con HTML)\n- Todos los scripts en orden correcto\n- Soporte completo para dark mode\n\nResultado esperado: El menú ya no debería auto-redirigir al hacer clic en botones\n\n🧠 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b91103cba2bba68e047a9a526f1358d3394bbc85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/b91103cba2bba68e047a9a526f1358d3394bbc85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDQzNjk4ODk0NmRiOTk3MWUzMjJjNTUyNDIxZjRmZjJjODZiNmVmMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/27772282753d4bcb416561b2d4236da12909c901","sha":"27772282753d4bcb416561b2d4236da12909c901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/27772282753d4bcb416561b2d4236da12909c901"}],"sha":"436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/436988946db9971e322c552421f4ff2c86b6ef1d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.gi