digo duplicado de dark mode\n- Limpieza de acentos corruptos (Ávila Camacho, ¿Tienes?)\n- Eliminación de código JavaScript expuesto en footer\n- Consolidación de Bootstrap JS y main.js\n- Sincronización con estructura de index.html","tree":{"sha":"ece1db3292ea06a864d2b3e50ee0954811556cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/ece1db3292ea06a864d2b3e50ee0954811556cc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/84fc751b53a3f1c604e188eaecaf198910d9ecd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/84fc751b53a3f1c604e188eaecaf198910d9ecd0","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDg0ZmM3NTFiNTNhM2YxYzYwNGUxODhlYWVjYWYxOTg5MTBkOWVjZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd","sha":"943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd"}],"sha":"84fc751b53a3f1c604e188eaecaf198910d9ecd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/84fc751b53a3f1c604e188eaecaf198910d9ecd0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T06:31:31Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T06:31:31Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(cache-busting): Solución definitiva para recarga de datos desde Neon\n\nPROBLEMA IDENTIFICADO:\n- Base de datos Neon: ✅ REPARADA (script SQL ejecutado exitosamente)\n- Navegador: ❌ Aún muestra caracteres corruptos (†, ◊, ¢)\n- Causa raíz: Backend Node.js cachea datos viejos en memoria\n\nSOLUCIÓN:\n1. Reiniciar completamente el servidor Node.js\n   - taskkill /IM node.exe /F (matar todos los procesos)\n   - Esperar 5 segundos\n   - npm start (reiniciar)\n\n2. Limpiar cache del navegador\n   - Ctrl+Shift+Delete\n   - Borrar cookies, cache, datos de sitios\n\n3. Reabre navegador y verifica\n\nARCHIVOS CREADOS:\n- docs/SOLUCION-FINAL-CACHE-BUSTING.md (instrucciones detalladas)\n- RESTART-SERVER-CLEAN.bat (script automatizado para Windows)\n\nPRÓXIMO PASO:\nUsuario ejecuta: taskkill /IM node.exe /F\nLuego: npm start\n\nRESULTADO ESPERADO:\nDespués de reiniciar backend y limpiar cache:\n- ✅ \"Martínez\" (NO \"Mart◊nez\")\n- ✅ \"López\" (NO \"L◊pez\")\n- ✅ \"María García\" (NO \"Mar◊a Garc◊a\")\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7ee7b1ef11e09688f0929f33e910ff4f5ca38a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/f7ee7b1ef11e09688f0929f33e910ff4f5ca38a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDk0M2E0Y2U1YWE1ODRmYzRkNmE2N2FkZGMxZjllZjAzYTkwZjE1ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1","sha":"2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1"}],"sha":"943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/943a4ce5aa584fc4d6a67addc1f9ef03a90f15dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T06:18:55Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T06:18:55Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(utf8-comprehensive-fixed): Corregir error de múltiples asignaciones en PostgreSQL\n\nPROBLEMA:\nERROR: multiple assignments to same column \"nombre\" (SQLSTATE 42601)\n\nCAUSA:\nEl script anterior intentaba hacer múltiples SET en la misma columna:\nSET nombre = REPLACE(...),\n    nombre = REPLACE(...)  ← ❌ Error en PostgreSQL\n\nSOLUCIÓN:\nUsar REPLACE anidados en una sola expresión:\nSET nombre = REPLACE(\n    REPLACE(\n        REPLACE(\n            REPLACE(nombre, ''†'', ''í''),\n            ''◊'', ''í''),\n        ''¢'', ''í''),\n    ''à'', ''á'')  ← ✅ Correcto\n\nNUEVO SCRIPT:\n- fix-neon-utf8-data-COMPREHENSIVE-FIXED.sql\n- Usa REPLACE anidados (sin múltiples SET)\n- Arregla: †, ◊, ¢, à en una sola pasada\n- SECCIÓN 4: Verificación completa\n- SECCIÓN 5: Ejemplos de datos arreglados\n\nPRÓXIMO PASO:\nUsuario ejecuta este script en Neon (ya está arreglado)\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"822f00c9deabf80c6a1a92872b95e1e0107dd230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/822f00c9deabf80c6a1a92872b95e1e0107dd230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDJmMjIzY2RjOGE5ZTUyMTZiY2I3Y2ZhYThiMzkwZTQzNDY2NGJjZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/3f9ee4eee579b972e1df7edc5b46c1fe2b47c458","sha":"3f9ee4eee579b972e1df7edc5b46c1fe2b47c458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/3f9ee4eee579b972e1df7edc5b46c1fe2b47c458"}],"sha":"2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2f223cdc8a9e5216bcb7cfaa8b390e434664bcf1"},{"author":null,