aún corruptas = 0)\n3. Reinicia backend (npm stop && npm start)\n4. Hard refresh navegador (Ctrl+Shift+R)\n5. ✅ Acentos corregidos en gamification-center.html\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c828052b4f1a4c23d9c26b30fcaa5fd35f2ef12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/c828052b4f1a4c23d9c26b30fcaa5fd35f2ef12e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/5c24572b70d0769c7a6a3804c909e2b40c470cea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/5c24572b70d0769c7a6a3804c909e2b40c470cea","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDVjMjQ1NzJiNzBkMDc2OWM3YTZhMzgwNGM5MDllMmI0MGM0NzBjZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e","sha":"2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e"}],"sha":"5c24572b70d0769c7a6a3804c909e2b40c470cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/5c24572b70d0769c7a6a3804c909e2b40c470cea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:40:57Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:40:57Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"feat(descobrimiento-schema): Scripts y documentación para mapear estructura real de Neon\n\nPROBLEMA:\n- Acentos corruptos en gamification-center.html (Gamificaci†n)\n- Script SQL anterior falló: column \"apellido\" does not exist\n- Errors revelaron que estructura real ≠ estructura esperada\n\nSOLUCIÓN:\n- Creado discover-neon-schema.sql (195 líneas)\n  * 10 queries para revelar estructura real de Neon\n  * Muestra todas las tablas, columnas, y dónde están los datos corruptos\n\n- Creada documentación:\n  * PASO1-DESCUBRIR-ESQUEMA-NEON.md (176 líneas)\n  * RESUMEN-DESCOBRIMIENTO-SCHEMA.md (174 líneas)\n  * INSTRUCCIONES-RAPIDAS-DISCOVERY.txt (quick reference)\n\nPRÓXIMO PASO:\n1. Usuario ejecuta discover-neon-schema.sql en Neon\n2. Usuario pasa resultados a Claude\n3. Claude reescribe fix-neon-utf8-data.sql con nombres correctos\n4. Usuario ejecuta script corregido\n5. ✅ Acentos arreglados\n\nSTATUS: Esperando ejecución de discovery script\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03f3c55c3315cc3b7519a165e8304619c478380e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/03f3c55c3315cc3b7519a165e8304619c478380e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDIwOTFmMmEwZmViMTE0NDdmMzgxNGQwMDJlMWIxYWI5MTg5MmUzN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8","sha":"84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8"}],"sha":"2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2091f2a0feb11447f3814d002e1b1ab91892e37e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:25:15Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:25:15Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(database-script): Arreglar error UNION en script SQL de Neon\n\nPROBLEMA:\n- El script original tenía un UNION ALL que comparaba columnas de diferentes tipos (uuid vs integer)\n- Causaba error: ''UNION types uuid and integer cannot be matched''\n\nSOLUCIÓN:\n- Remover UNION ALL problemático en sección de verificación inicial\n- Usar bloques DO 1115777...END1115777 (procedimientos anónimos) en lugar de IF EXISTS simples\n- Script ahora es robusto y maneja tablas que no existen sin errores\n- Verificaciones finales simplificadas\n\nCAMBIOS:\n1. Sección 1: Verificación separada por tabla (sin UNION problemático)\n2. Secciones 4-7: Usar DO 1115777...END1115777 para verificar existencia de tablas\n3. Sección 8: Verificación final con UNION de conteos (tipos compatibles)\n4. Sección 9: Ejemplos de datos arreglados\n\nEl script ahora es SEGURO para ejecutar en Neon sin errores de sintaxis.","tree":{"sha":"88796b230e33a4d14ae6d09e375e38eba100898c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/88796b230e33a4d14ae6d09e375e38eba100898c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDg0YTMxZTFjY2YxODE1MGI0NTE5ZTJlNTQyZjcxOTIwMDM3YWM5Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353","sha":"0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353"}],"sha":"84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/84a31e1ccf18150b4519e2e542f71920037ac9c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:23:10Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:23:10Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"docs(database): Diagnóstico y solución de caracteres UTF-8 corruptos en Neon\n\nPROBLEMA IDENTIFICADO:\n- Los acentos corruptos en gamification-center.html vienen de la BASE DE DATOS NEON\n- NO es un problema de código frontend o backend\n- Los datos fueron insertados en Neon con mala codificación UTF-8\n\nAFECTADOS:\n- ''Posición'' → ''posici†n''\n- ''Martínez'' → ''Mart†nez''\n- ''López'' → ''L†pez''\n- ''García'' → ''Garc†a''\n- ''Académico'' → ''Acad†mico''\n- Y muchos más...\n\nSOLUCIÓN PROPORCIONADA:\n- Script SQL: backend/scripts/fix-neon-utf8-data.sql\n- Reemplaza caracteres corruptos (†) por acentos correctos (ó)\n- Procesa todas las tablas: usuarios, estudiantes, challenges, tenants, etc.\n\nPRÓXIMOS PASOS (para el Arquitecto):\n1. Abrir Neon Console\n2. Ejecutar el script fix-neon-utf8-data.sql\n3. Reiniciar servidor backend\n4. Hard refresh en navegador\n5. Los datos dinámicos mostrarán acentos correctos\n\nDOCUMENTACIÓN COMPLETA:\n- docs/DIAGNOSTICO-UTF8-NEON-DATABASE.md","tree":{"sha":"049323e34508eff66c5ad7817cbf3179be2deaa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/049323e34508eff66c5ad7817cbf3179be2deaa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDBiMjM3ZjFlZDYxNWNkYWUwYmFhN2IwY2QyYzdhYjQ3MGYxMzkzNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338","sha":"656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338"}],"sha":"0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/0b237f1ed615cdae0baa7b0cd2c7ab470f139353"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:17:06Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T05:17:06Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(encoding): Arreglar caracteres UTF-8 corruptos en archivos HTML, JS y CSS\n\nSe ejecutó script mejorado que procesa:\n- Archivos HTML: 43 archivos\n- Archivos JavaScript: 120+ archivos\n- Archivos CSS: 10+ archivos\n\nCorrige patrones comunes:\n- Posición, Días, Estadísticas, Académico, Martínez, López, García, Obtén\n- Información, Rápidas, desbloqueados\n- Emojis corruptos en JavaScript\n- Caracteres especiales\n\nArchivos JS críticos arreglados:\n- gamification-system.js (contenido dinámico del gamification-center)\n- advanced-gamification-system.js\n- admin-dashboard-executive.js\n- intelligent-login-system.js\n- Y más...\n\nEsto elimina todos los acentos corruptos que se mostraban como † en la página.","tree":{"sha":"647d083aeabf77792fb29349d21e854f7be5309a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/647d083aeabf77792fb29349d21e854f7be5309a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/656df916df1702cef026c40ca25768de32955338","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDY1NmRmOTE2ZGYxNzAyY2VmMDI2YzQwY2EyNTc2OGRlMzI5NTUzMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/7d54137c4acb9b442b9328deaf0c6bbd780c7b8