NTAJAS:\n🎯 UN ÚNICO CAMBIO en global-layout.css se aplica a TODAS las páginas automáticamente\n🎯 Consistencia garantizada - Header, footer y botones idénticos en todo el sitio\n🎯 Mantenibilidad mejorada - No hay estilos duplicados\n🎯 Performance mejor - Un CSS unificado en lugar de 43 copies diferentes\n\nPÁGINAS CON ACTUALIZACIONES:\n✅ 43 páginas HTML configuradas correctamente\n✅ CSS centralizado y compartido\n✅ Headers/footers consistentes en todas las páginas\n✅ Botones flotantes idénticos en todas partes\n\nESTRUCTURA FINAL:\n- css/global-layout.css: CSS global ÚNICO compartido por todas las páginas\n- partials/footer.html: HTML puro sin estilos inline\n- partials/header.html: HTML puro sin estilos inline\n- Todas las páginas usan los mismos estilos y componentes","tree":{"sha":"68087bad9d1c9085153b926c622edd3d5e95a8fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/68087bad9d1c9085153b926c622edd3d5e95a8fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2e6d2b0679c1d0b95e9c281287048c9d9201414f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/2e6d2b0679c1d0b95e9c281287048c9d9201414f","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDJlNmQyYjA2NzljMWQwYjk1ZTljMjgxMjg3MDQ4YzlkOTIwMTQxNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/a9b3ca1c151edf1662b15393f301a2655fb34459","sha":"a9b3ca1c151edf1662b15393f301a2655fb34459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/a9b3ca1c151edf1662b15393f301a2655fb34459"}],"sha":"2e6d2b0679c1d0b95e9c281287048c9d9201414f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2e6d2b0679c1d0b95e9c281287048c9d9201414f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/a9b3ca1c151edf1662b15393f301a2655fb34459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T03:36:44Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"