/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/9a9bf3161ece5141e3602452c9e507a228d31713/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T03:28:58Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T03:28:58Z","email":"tu-email@ejemplo.com","name":"Tu Nombre"},"message":"fix(footer): Remover propiedades CSS que causaban footer overlay - width: 100vw, margin-left: 50%, transform\n\nEl footer.html tenía propiedades CSS que hacían que el footer se superpusiera al contenido principal en lugar de estar al final de la página:\n- width: 100vw (100% del viewport width) en lugar de 100% (100% del container)\n- margin-left: 50% y transform: translateX(-50%) causaban centrado incorrecto\n\nCAMBIOS:\n- .footer-main width: 100vw → 100%\n- .footer-main margin-left: 50% → margin: 0\n- .footer-main transform: translateX(-50%) removido\n- Agregado padding: 2rem 0 para espaciado proper\n\nPÁGINAS AFECTADAS:\n- gamification-center.html (ahora footer al final)\n- challenges.html (ahora footer al final)\n- iacoins-dashboard.html (ahora footer al final)\n- iacoins-store.html (ahora footer al final)\n\nEste era el problema crítico reportado por el usuario en Message 16.\nEl footer ahora debe aparecer correctamente al final de cada página, exactamente como en index.html","tree":{"sha":"d93795c7d9dcba7b1e05332ec2cff5c88ff72208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/d93795c7d9dcba7b1e05332ec2cff5c88ff72208"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/9a9bf3161ece5141e3602452c9e507a228d31713","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/9a9bf3161ece5141e3602452c9e507a228d31713","node_id":"C_kwDOPvic7NoAKDlhOWJmMzE2MWVjZTUxNDFlMzYwMjQ1MmM5ZTUwN2EyMjhkMzE3MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commit/40ef02aad2fb00783c6eeeb6e09a977fb1239300","sha":"40ef02aad2