/api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/d4ba8a51f5526de4408dba3f7057c0e2a3d6a4c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-21T03:25:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-21T03:25:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(integration): FASE 1 COMPLETADA - Event Bus + Subscribers integrados\n\nFASE 1: INTEGRACIÓN DE REFACTORIZACIÓN (SEMANAS 1-12)\nDuración: ~2 horas de trabajo autónomo\nEstado: ✅ COMPLETADA EXITOSAMENTE\n\n## Cambios Principales\n\n### 1. Frontend Integration (admin-dashboard.html)\n- Agregados 9 scripts de nueva arquitectura Event-Driven\n- Event Bus frontend + Dashboard Core + Unified Auth\n- 6 módulos independientes (students, grades, attendance, notifications, reports, settings)\n\n### 2. Backend Integration (server.js)\n- Inicialización de Event Bus Service\n- Registro de Notification Subscriber (40+ event handlers)\n- Registro de Analytics Subscriber (40+ event handlers)\n- Event Bus disponible globalmente como app.eventBus\n\n### 3. Bugs Reparados (3 errores críticos)\n- migration.js comentado (requería mysql2, proyecto usa PostgreSQL)\n- ioredis instalado (requerido por socket-service.js)\n- Exportaciones corregidas en subscribers (clase en lugar de instancia)\n\n### 4. Configuración\n- .env.example creado (73 líneas, 12 secciones)\n- Dependencias: +ioredis (9 paquetes adicionales)\n\n### 5. Documentación\n- docs/FASE-1-INTEGRACION-COMPLETADA.md (500+ líneas)\n- Resumen ejecutivo, estadísticas, próximos pasos\n\n## Validación\n\n✅ 19/19 archivos con sintaxis correcta (node -c)\n✅ Servidor iniciando exitosamente\n✅ Event Bus backend operativo\n✅ 2 Subscribers registrados (80+ event handlers totales)\n✅ Endpoint /api/health respondiendo\n\n## Archivos Modificados\n- backend/server.js (+30 líneas integración)\n- backend/subscribers/notification-subscriber.js (export corregido)\n- backend/subscribers/analytics-subscriber.js (export corregido)\n- public/admin-dashboard.html (+9 scripts)\n- package.json (+ioredis)\n\n## Próximo Paso\nFASE 2: Testing & Debugging (estimado 4-6 horas)","tree":{"sha":"712b1f3858f35cbf1ef6df3fa664945c923525cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/712b1f3858f35cbf1ef6df3fa664945c923525cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/d4ba8a51f5526de4408dba3f7057c0e2a3d6a4c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 712b1f3858f35cbf1ef6df3fa664945c923525cb\nparent 960165a41a0bba720e59f0f4e8de33d305ca4c53\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763695539 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763695539 +0000\n\nfeat(integration): FASE 1 COMPLETADA - Event Bus + Subscribers integrados\n\nFASE 1: INTEGRACIÓN DE REFACTORIZACIÓN (SEMANAS 1-12)\nDuración: ~2 horas de trabajo autónomo\nEstado: ✅ COMPLETADA EXITOSAMENTE\n\n## Cambios Principales\n\n### 1. Frontend Integration (admin-dashboard.html)\n- Agregados 9 scripts de nueva arquitectura Event-Driven\n- Event Bus frontend + Dashboard Core + Unified Auth\n- 6 módulos independientes (students, grades, attendance, notifications, reports, settings)\n\n### 2. Backend Integration (server.js)\n- Inicialización de Event Bus Service\n- Registro de Notification Subscriber (40+ event handlers)\n- Registro de Analytics Subscriber (40+ event handlers)\n- Event Bus disponible globalmente como app.eventBus\n\n### 3. Bugs Reparados (3 errores críticos)\n- migration.js comentado (requería mysql2, proyecto usa PostgreSQL)\n- ioredis instalado (requerido por socket-service.js)\n- Exportaciones corregidas en subscribers (clase en lugar de instancia)\n\n### 4. Configuración\n- .env.example creado (73 líneas, 12 secciones)\n- Dependencias: +ioredis (9 paquetes adicionales)\n\n### 5. Documentación\n- docs/FASE-1-INTEGRACION-COMPLETADA.md (500+ líneas)\n- Resumen ejecutivo, estadísticas, próximos pasos\n\n## Validación\n\n✅ 19/19 archivos con sintaxis correcta (node -c)\n✅ Servidor iniciando exitosamente\n✅ Event Bus backend operativo\n✅ 2 Subscribers registrados (80+ event handlers totales)\n✅ Endpoint /api/health respondiendo\n\n## Archivos Modificados\n- backend/server.js (+30 líneas integración)\n- backend/subscribers/notification-subscriber.js (export corregido)\n- backend/subscribers/analytics-subscriber.js (export corregido)\n- public/admin-dashboard.html (+9 scripts)\n- package.json (+ioredis)\n\n## Próximo Paso\nFASE 2: Testing & Debugging (estimado 4-6 horas)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFTcl+Ep\ni164r4Vn7jn5pyAtzKglLrnbRKnBUBhaQ7OEfxTieNsrESYvCtMivrsna8Xkc/9ZLmNkbH9v+gN4\n6Qw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-21T03:26:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":