"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/a2edf9ada6f1aea4c2dc625793ab7f60b3826d3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T20:38:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T20:38:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(semana-27): GDPR Compliance Module completo\n\nTAREA 1: GDPR Compliance (Reglamento General de Protección de Datos)\n\nNuevos archivos:\n- backend/services/gdprComplianceService.js (750+ líneas)\n  * Right to Access (Artículo 15): Export user data (JSON/CSV/XML)\n  * Right to Erasure (Artículo 17): Delete user data with backup\n  * Data Portability (Artículo 20): Export in multiple formats\n  * Consent Management (Artículo 7): Record/retrieve consents\n  * Data Breach Notification (Artículo 33-34): 72-hour reporting\n  * Anonymization: Alternative to deletion\n  * Audit logging completo\n\n- backend/routes/gdpr.js (320+ líneas)\n  * GET /api/gdpr/export/:userId - Export user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/delete/:userId - Delete user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/anonymize/:userId - Anonymize user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/consent - Record consent\n  * GET /api/gdpr/consents/:userId - Get user consents\n  * POST /api/gdpr/breach - Report data breach (admin only)\n  * GET /api/gdpr/stats - Compliance statistics (admin only)\n\n- backend/scripts/create-gdpr-tables.sql (200+ líneas)\n  * consents: Consent tracking con IP/user-agent\n  * data_exports: Export history\n  * deleted_users: Backup de datos eliminados (90 días)\n  * data_breaches: Breach tracking y notification\n  * audit_logs: Audit trail completo\n  * privacy_policies: Policy version management\n  * user_privacy_policy_acceptance: User acceptance tracking\n\nFeatures implementadas:\n✅ Right to Access (export JSON/CSV/XML)\n✅ Right to Erasure (delete con backup)\n✅ Data Portability (3 formatos)\n✅ Consent Management (granular por tipo)\n✅ Data Breach Notification (72-hour deadline)\n✅ Anonymization (cuando delete no es posible)\n✅ Audit logging automático\n✅ Privacy policy versioning\n✅ User consent tracking con IP/user-agent\n\nCaracterísticas de seguridad:\n- Authorization checks en todos los endpoints\n- Confirmation required para delete/anonymize\n- Backup de datos eliminados (90 días retention)\n- Audit trail completo de accesos a datos personales\n- 72-hour breach notification tracking\n- Portable y modular (zero BGE dependencies)\n\nTabla GDPR compliance (7 tablas):\n1. consents (usuario_id, consent_type, granted)\n2. data_exports (usuario_id, format, size)\n3. deleted_users (user_id, backup_data, deletion_date)\n4. data_breaches (type, severity, affected_users_count)\n5. audit_logs (usuario_id, action, timestamp)\n6. privacy_policies (version, content, effective_date)\n7. user_privacy_policy_acceptance (usuario_id, policy_version)\n\nUso:\n// Export user data\nconst exportData = await gdprService.exportUserData(userId, ''json'');\n\n// Delete user data\nawait gdprService.deleteUserData(userId, { reason: ''User request'' });\n\n// Record consent\nawait gdprService.recordConsent(userId, ''email_marketing'', true);\n\n// Report breach\nawait gdprService.reportDataBreach({\n  type: ''unauthorized_access'',\n  severity: ''high'',\n  affectedUsersCount: 150,\n  description: ''Detailed description''\n});\n\nTotal SEMANA 27-28 (parcial): ~1,270 líneas de código\nEstado: v5.2.0 → v5.3.0 (GDPR completo)\n\nPróximo: WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility + SOC2 Readiness","tree":{"sha":"f4ebd6ce30544a3c29d0de09914cbc391c45ca5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/f4ebd6ce30544a3c29d0de09914cbc391c45ca5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/a2edf9ada6f1aea4c2dc625793ab7f60b3826d3c","verification":{"payload":"tree f4ebd6ce30544a3c29d0de09914cbc391c45ca5a\nparent 2c8993e373b109f026fc42d68d71fcf465040228\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763671093 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763671093 +0000\n\nfeat(semana-27): GDPR Compliance Module completo\n\nTAREA 1: GDPR Compliance (Reglamento General de Protección de Datos)\n\nNuevos archivos:\n- backend/services/gdprComplianceService.js (750+ líneas)\n  * Right to Access (Artículo 15): Export user data (JSON/CSV/XML)\n  * Right to Erasure (Artículo 17): Delete user data with backup\n  * Data Portability (Artículo 20): Export in multiple formats\n  * Consent Management (Artículo 7): Record/retrieve consents\n  * Data Breach Notification (Artículo 33-34): 72-hour reporting\n  * Anonymization: Alternative to deletion\n  * Audit logging completo\n\n- backend/routes/gdpr.js (320+ líneas)\n  * GET /api/gdpr/export/:userId - Export user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/delete/:userId - Delete user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/anonymize/:userId - Anonymize user data\n  * POST /api/gdpr/consent - Record consent\n  * GET /api/gdpr/consents/:userId - Get user consents\n  * POST /api/gdpr/breach - Report data breach (admin only)\n  * GET /api/gdpr/stats - Compliance statistics (admin only)\n\n- backend/scripts/create-gdpr-tables.sql (200+ líneas)\n  * consents: Consent tracking con IP/user-agent\n  * data_exports: Export history\n  * deleted_users: Backup de datos eliminados (90 días)\n  * data_breaches: Breach tracking y notification\n  * audit_logs: Audit trail completo\n  * privacy_policies: Policy version management\n  * user_privacy_policy_acceptance: User acceptance tracking\n\nFeatures implementadas:\n✅ Right to Access (export JSON/CSV/XML)\n✅ Right to Erasure (delete con backup)\n✅ Data Portability (3 formatos)\n✅ Consent Management (granular por tipo)\n✅ Data Breach Notification (72-hour deadline)\n✅ Anonymization (cuando delete no es posible)\n✅ Audit logging automático\n✅ Privacy policy versioning\n✅ User consent tracking con IP/user-agent\n\nCaracterísticas de seguridad:\n- Authorization checks en todos los endpoints\n- Confirmation required para delete/anonymize\n- Backup de datos eliminados (90 días retention)\n- Audit trail completo de accesos a datos personales\n- 72-hour breach notification tracking\n- Portable y modular (zero BGE dependencies)\n\nTabla GDPR compliance (7 tablas):\n1. consents (usuario_id, consent_type, granted)\n2. data_exports (usuario_id, format, size)\n3. deleted_users (user_id, backup_data, deletion_date)\n4. data_breaches (type, severity, affected_users_count)\n5. audit_logs (usuario_id, action, timestamp)\n6. privacy_policies (version, content, effective_date)\n7. user_privacy_policy_acceptance (usuario_id, policy_version)\n\nUso:\n// Export user data\nconst exportData = await gdprService.exportUserData(userId, ''json'');\n\n// Delete user data\nawait gdprService.deleteUserData(userId, { reason: ''User request'' });\n\n// Record consent\nawait gdprService.recordConsent(userId, ''email_marketing'', true);\n\n// Report breach\nawait gdprService.reportDataBreach({\n  type: ''unauthorized_access'',\n  severity: ''high'',\n  affectedUsersCount: 150,\n  description: ''Detailed description''\n});\n\nTotal SEMANA 27-28 (parcial): ~1,270 líneas de código\nEstado: v5.2.0 → v5.3.0 (GDPR completo)\n\nPróximo: WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility + SOC2 Readiness\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG9GLXjs\n9aGdLd5BgT54PgUATMbb8B7gNt0HsxsrEaP0LA