);\nconst loggedQuery = queryLogger.loggedQuery.bind(queryLogger);\nconst result = await loggedQuery(pool, ''SELECT * FROM usuarios WHERE email = $1'', [email]);\n\n# Performance Analyzer (script)\nnode backend/scripts/analyze-query-performance.js\n\nMétricas esperadas:\n- Identificar top 10 queries >100ms\n- Generar 5+ index recommendations\n- Reducir query time en 40-60% con índices\n\nSEMANA 26 COMPLETADA AL 100%:\n✅ TAREA 1: Caching Multi-Capa (700+ líneas)\n✅ TAREA 2: Query Optimization (740+ líneas)\n✅ TAREA 3: APM Monitoring (560+ líneas)\n✅ TAREA 4: Error Tracking (680+ líneas)\n✅ TAREA 5: Bundle Optimization (770+ líneas + guía)\n\nTotal SEMANA 26: ~3,450 líneas de código + documentación\nEstado: v5.1.0 → v5.2.0 (SEMANA 26 COMPLETA)","tree":{"sha":"eef9e079397120eec28187c13637d93f4cb81a0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/eef9e079397120eec28187c13637d93f4cb81a0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2c8993e373b109f026fc42d68d71fcf465040228","verification":{"payload":"tree eef9e079397120eec28187c13637d93f4cb81a0f\nparent 58400eddb566f3f1d51d2fa6dc6a4f762c57fb82\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763670769 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763670769 +0000\n\nperf(semana-26): Query Optimization - Logger + EXPLAIN ANALYZE automation\n\nTAREA 2: Query Performance Optimization (100%)\n\nNuevos archivos:\n- backend/middleware/queryLogger.js (400+ líneas)\n  * Query logging con detección de slow queries (>100ms)\n  * Pattern detection para queries repetitivas\n  * Optimization suggestions automáticas\n  * Statistics tracking por tabla y tipo de query\n  * Auto-cleanup cada hora\n\n- backend/scripts/analyze-query-performance.js (340+ líneas)\n  * EXPLAIN ANALYZE automation para common queries\n  * Sequential scan detection\n  * Index recommendations\n  * Row estimate mismatch detection\n  * Genera recommended-indexes.sql automáticamente\n\nFeatures implementadas:\n✅ Slow query detection