{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/2f4d66cc6ca72e920c9d4ff787798c9b2337a013/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T19:44:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T19:44:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(semana-26): Error Tracking & Logging System completo\n\n✨ NUEVO: Error Tracker + Error Middleware\n\n**Error Tracker (backend/services/errorTracker.js):**\n- 🔴 Error aggregation y deduplicación automática\n- Stack trace capture y parsing\n- Error grouping por fingerprint (MD5 hash)\n- Error rate monitoring con alerting\n- Severity classification (critical, high, medium, low)\n- Historical error data (24h retention)\n- Error fingerprinting para identificar errores únicos\n- Alerting en errores críticos (>10 occurrencias)\n- Statistics tracking (por tipo, severity, context)\n- Integration con devLogger\n\n**Error Middleware (backend/middleware/errorMiddleware.js):**\n- ⚡ Automatic error capture en Express\n- Structured error responses (JSON)\n- Error context extraction (userId, endpoint, IP, userAgent)\n- Custom error handlers:\n  - validationErrorHandler (Joi, Mongoose)\n  - databaseErrorHandler (PostgreSQL error codes)\n  - authErrorHandler (401, 403)\n- Stack trace sanitization en producción\n- asyncHandler wrapper para async routes\n- AppError class customizable\n- 404 Not Found handler\n\n🔧 Features:\n- Error deduplication (5 min window)\n- Top 10 error groups por frecuencia\n- Recent errors tracking (últimos 50)\n- Error fingerprinting con MD5\n- Critical error patterns detection:\n  - ECONNREFUSED, ETIMEDOUT\n  - Database errors\n  - Authentication failures\n- Automatic cleanup cada 1 hora\n- Max 1000 errors en memoria\n\n📊 Endpoint de Errores:\n```javascript\nGET /api/admin/errors\nResponse: {\n  totalErrors: 1234,\n  uniqueErrorTypes: 45,\n  errorRate: \"67 errors/hour\",\n  byType: { TypeError: 123, ... },\n  bySeverity: { critical: 12, high: 34, ... },\n  topErrorGroups: [\n    { fingerprint, message, count, firstSeen, lastSeen }\n  ],\n  recentErrors: []\n}\n```\n\n🎯 Uso:\n```javascript\n// Automatic capture\napp.use(errorMiddleware.validationErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.databaseErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.authErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.notFound);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.errorHandler);\n\n// Manual tracking\nconst errorTracker = require(''./services/errorTracker'');\nerrorTracker.trackError(error, {\n  context: ''api/users'',\n  userId: 123,\n  severity: ''high''\n});\n\n// Async route wrapper\napp.get(''/api/data'', asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {\n  const data = await someAsyncOperation();\n  res.json(data);\n}));\n```\n\n📦 Archivos:\n- backend/services/errorTracker.js (460+ líneas)\n- backend/middleware/errorMiddleware.js (220+ líneas)\n\nTotal: ~680 líneas de código\n\nEstado: SEMANA 26 - TAREA 4 COMPLETADA ✅","tree":{"sha":"9e8e00b1e8d43b693b53f50d8eaec6f25f1dbffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/9e8e00b1e8d43b693b53f50d8eaec6f25f1dbffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/2f4d66cc6ca72e920c9d4ff787798c9b2337a013","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e8e00b1e8d43b693b53f50d8eaec6f25f1dbffc\nparent b2e1aa4e47afbd69e42def90bc64a2bf0938877d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763667873 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763667873 +0000\n\nfeat(semana-26): Error Tracking & Logging System completo\n\n✨ NUEVO: Error Tracker + Error Middleware\n\n**Error Tracker (backend/services/errorTracker.js):**\n- 🔴 Error aggregation y deduplicación automática\n- Stack trace capture y parsing\n- Error grouping por fingerprint (MD5 hash)\n- Error rate monitoring con alerting\n- Severity classification (critical, high, medium, low)\n- Historical error data (24h retention)\n- Error fingerprinting para identificar errores únicos\n- Alerting en errores críticos (>10 occurrencias)\n- Statistics tracking (por tipo, severity, context)\n- Integration con devLogger\n\n**Error Middleware (backend/middleware/errorMiddleware.js):**\n- ⚡ Automatic error capture en Express\n- Structured error responses (JSON)\n- Error context extraction (userId, endpoint, IP, userAgent)\n- Custom error handlers:\n  - validationErrorHandler (Joi, Mongoose)\n  - databaseErrorHandler (PostgreSQL error codes)\n  - authErrorHandler (401, 403)\n- Stack trace sanitization en producción\n- asyncHandler wrapper para async routes\n- AppError class customizable\n- 404 Not Found handler\n\n🔧 Features:\n- Error deduplication (5 min window)\n- Top 10 error groups por frecuencia\n- Recent errors tracking (últimos 50)\n- Error fingerprinting con MD5\n- Critical error patterns detection:\n  - ECONNREFUSED, ETIMEDOUT\n  - Database errors\n  - Authentication failures\n- Automatic cleanup cada 1 hora\n- Max 1000 errors en memoria\n\n📊 Endpoint de Errores:\n```javascript\nGET /api/admin/errors\nResponse: {\n  totalErrors: 1234,\n  uniqueErrorTypes: 45,\n  errorRate: \"67 errors/hour\",\n  byType: { TypeError: 123, ... },\n  bySeverity: { critical: 12, high: 34, ... },\n  topErrorGroups: [\n    { fingerprint, message, count, firstSeen, lastSeen }\n  ],\n  recentErrors: []\n}\n```\n\n🎯 Uso:\n```javascript\n// Automatic capture\napp.use(errorMiddleware.validationErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.databaseErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.authErrorHandler);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.notFound);\napp.use(errorMiddleware.errorHandler);\n\n// Manual tracking\nconst errorTracker = require(''./services/errorTracker'');\nerrorTracker.trackError(error, {\n  context: ''api/users'',\n  userId: 123,\n  severity: ''high''\n});\n\n// Async route wrapper\napp.get(''/api/data'', asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {\n  const data = await someAsyncOperation();\n  res.json(data);\n}));\n```\n\n📦 Archivos:\n- backend/services/errorTracker.js (460+ líneas)\n- backend/middleware/errorMiddleware.js (220+ líneas)\n\nTotal: ~680 líneas de código\n\nEstado: SEMANA 26 - TAREA 4 COMPLETADA ✅\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCa8I8nz\n0DJ6vvfEDV5iMv3jR0cmEwEaMIezurWsgPbyKxCSGlt5HSgCjKUm+gUg3QUkylNLLfIBZaC3EMh6\nUQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-20T19:47:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SACRINT/sipweb-