e tracking (user + system)\n- Slow endpoint detection (>500ms threshold)\n- Real-time metrics aggregation (1 min windows)\n- Historical data retention (1 hour)\n- System metrics tracking (cada 10s)\n\n**Performance Middleware (backend/middleware/performanceMiddleware.js):**\n- ⚡ Automatic request timing para todos los endpoints\n- Response time headers (X-Response-Time, X-Request-ID)\n- Performance metric collection\n- Error tracking integration\n- Zero-config, plug-and-play\n\n🔧 Features:\n- Percentile calculations (p50, p95, p99) para latency\n- Top 10 endpoints por traffic y latency\n- Status code distribution\n- Slow requests tracking (últimos 10)\n- Recent errors tracking (últimos 10)\n- Memory alerts (threshold: 512MB)\n- Error rate alerts (threshold: 5%)\n\n📊 Métricas Disponibles:\n- Current window metrics (real-time)\n- Latest aggregated metrics (último minuto)\n- System metrics (memory, CPU, uptime)\n- Slow requests list\n- Recent errors list\n- Historical data (últimas 10 ventanas)\n\n🎯 Endpoint de Métricas:\n```javascript\nGET /api/admin/performance\nResponse: {\n  current: { requests, errors, errorRate, avgLatency },\n  latest: { p50, p95, p99, throughput, endpoints[] },\n  system: { memory, uptime },\n  slowRequests: [],\n  recentErrors: [],\n  history: []\n}\n```\n\n📦 Archivos:\n- backend/services/performanceMonitor.js (480+ líneas)\n- backend/middleware/performanceMiddleware.js (80+ líneas)\n\nTotal: ~560 líneas de código\n\nEstado: SEMANA 26 - TAREA 3 COMPLETADA ✅","tree":{"sha":"ac05eeac5d11857886daf97bcedbb3321df29f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/ac05eeac5d11857886daf97bcedbb3321df29f7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/5d9b26cd255e31c7d69781ae2753920b562545ce","verification":{"payload":"tree ac05eeac5d11857886daf97bcedbb3321df29f7d\nparent 3bd05be70f53171b3a4304047f0b64219d7a443b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763665869 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 17