ude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/commits/3bd05be70f53171b3a4304047f0b64219d7a443b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T19:09:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T19:09:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(semana-26): Sistema de Caching Multi-Capa completo\n\n✨ NUEVO: Cache Manager + Cache Middleware\n\n**Cache Manager (backend/services/cacheManager.js):**\n- 🚀 Multi-layer caching (L1: in-memory LRU, L2: Redis)\n- TTL configurables por key (default: 5 min)\n- Cache invalidation (individual, pattern, full)\n- Statistics tracking (hit rate, miss rate, latency)\n- LRU eviction al alcanzar límites\n- Graceful fallback (Redis → in-memory → no cache)\n- Namespace support para multi-tenancy\n- Auto-cleanup cada 60 segundos\n- Redis opcional con auto-fallback\n\n**Cache Middleware (backend/middleware/cacheMiddleware.js):**\n- ⚡ Caching automático de responses GET\n- Cache invalidation en POST/PUT/DELETE\n- Custom cache keys (path, user, query)\n- TTL pre-configurados por endpoint\n- Cache bypass con header X-No-Cache\n- Headers informativos (X-Cache: HIT/MISS, X-Cache-Key)\n- Portable y modular\n\n🔧 Features:\n- In-memory LRU cache (max 1000 items, 100MB)\n- Redis integration opcional (ioredis)\n- TTL defaults: config/tenant (5min), noticias (10min), egresados (30min)\n- Hit rate tracking con estadísticas\n- Latency tracking (avg latency)\n- Memory usage tracking\n\n📊 Endpoints Pre-Configurados:\n- /api/config/tenant: 5 min TTL\n- /api/noticias: 10 min TTL\n- /api/egresados: 30 min TTL\n- /api/admin/stats: 1 min TTL\n- /api/students, /teachers, /parents: 5 min TTL\n\n🎯 Uso:\n```javascript\n// Automatic caching\nconst { cacheResponse, invalidateCache } = require(''./middleware/cacheMiddleware'');\n\napp.get(''/api/noticias'', cacheResponse({ ttl: 600000 }), handler);\napp.post(''/api/noticias'', invalidateCache({ pattern: () => ''http:/api/noticias*'' }), handler);\n\n// Manual caching\nconst cacheManager = require(''./services/cacheManager'');\nawait cacheManager.set(''user:123'', userData, { ttl: 300000 });\nconst user = await cacheManager.get(''user:123'');\n```\n\n📦 Archivos:\n- backend/services/cacheManager.js (700+ líneas)\n- backend/middleware/cacheMiddleware.js (220+ líneas)\n- docs/SEMANA-26-PERFORMANCE-MONITORING-PLAN.md (plan completo)\n\nTotal: ~920 líneas de código\n\nEstado: SEMANA 26 - TAREA 1 COMPLETADA ✅","tree":{"sha":"884caf756f18f0156d3c466b30b3508c338d8db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/884caf756f18f0156d3c466b30b3508c338d8db1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/3bd05be70f53171b3a4304047f0b64219d7a443b","verification":{"payload":"tree 884caf756f18f0156d3c466b30b3508c338d8db1\nparent 65c097f4916f0121fc7535c78a76c8def682846f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763665747 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763665747 +0000\n\nfeat(semana-26): Sistema de Caching Multi-Capa completo\n\n✨ NUEVO: Cache Manager + Cache Middleware\n\n**Cache Manager (backend/services/cacheManager.js):**\n- 🚀 Multi-layer caching (L1: in-memory LRU, L2: Redis)\n- TTL configurables por key (default: 5 min)\n- Cache invali