tomático\n- Request size validation (10MB max)\n- Content-Type validation\n- User-Agent blocking\n- Auto-cleanup cada 5 minutos\n\n✨ NUEVO: 12 Enterprise Security Headers\n- ✅ HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)\n- ✅ X-Frame-Options (clickjacking prevention)\n- ✅ X-Content-Type-Options (MIME sniffing prevention)\n- ✅ X-XSS-Protection (legacy but useful)\n- ✅ Content-Security-Policy (CSP) - 11 directives\n- ✅ Referrer-Policy (privacy)\n- ✅ Permissions-Policy (feature policy)\n- ✅ X-Download-Options (IE8+)\n- ✅ X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies\n- ✅ Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP)\n- ✅ Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP)\n- ✅ Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy (CORP)\n\n🔧 Features:\n- Security score calculator\n- Grade system (A+ to F)\n- Dynamic CSP builder\n- Logging detallado con prefijos\n- Production/development config\n\n📦 Archivos:\n- backend/middleware/waf.js (425 líneas)\n- backend/middleware/securityHeaders.js (272 líneas)\n\nEstado: TAREA 4.1 y 4.2 COMPLETADAS ✅","tree":{"sha":"0864b0fa36df629c22257167402eba343eb24f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/trees/0864b0fa36df629c22257167402eba343eb24f72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SACRINT/sipweb-bg/git/commits/6705e0a3a63331157ee9826c80b00a60d1521ab7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0864b0fa36df629c22257167402eba343eb24f72\nparent 93d8cf26f7248de0766e1315816432898280f9ed\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763664962 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763664962 +0000\n\nfeat(semana-25): Security Hardening - WAF + 12 Enterprise Headers\n\n✨ NUEVO: Web Application Firewall (WAF)\n- 🛡️ Protección OWASP Top 10\n- 14 patrones SQL Injection detection\n- 9 patrones XSS prevention\n- Path Traversal protection\n- Command Injection detection\n- Rate limiting (100 req/min per IP)\n- IP blacklist/whitelist automático\n- Request size validation (10MB max)\n- Content-Type validation\n- User-Agent blocking\n- Auto-cleanup cada 5 minutos\n\n✨ NUEVO: 12 Enterprise Security Headers\n- ✅