bcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:30:53Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:30:53Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"fix: ship the KDexHostExtension CRD in the release installer\n\nconfig/crd/kustomization.yaml listed 29 of the 30 bases, so\n`make build-installer` produced an install.yaml without\nkdexhostextensions and nexus (which watches the kind) would crash-loop.\nA guard test now asserts every config/crd/bases file is listed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f06215a5570b1af2a616ee5ef14656cba8ceab75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/f06215a5570b1af2a616ee5ef14656cba8ceab75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/ce30815842a6b98770f75b1757b308e942d34bcb","verification":{"payload":"tree f06215a5570b1af2a616ee5ef14656cba8ceab75\nparent d5c95da2ac532915ff43b1746aede8dcb8f8f027\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1791214253 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1791214253 -0400\n\nfix: ship the KDexHostExtension CRD in the release installer\n\nconfig/crd/kustomization.yaml listed 29 of the 30 bases, so\n`make build-installer` produced an install.yaml without\nkdexhostextensions and nexus (which watches the kind) would crash-loop.\nA guard test now asserts every config/crd/bases file is listed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGFEjBdxj3KifUiRrvKJ0+lOSbbsJiZI8cgPVkBerNMv7b69/eDZQ+oXlEtDKC/oQj\nDQXW30k/NlAv7L0C6riw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T15:39:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4