nd Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:21:28Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"feat: KDexPage rewrite mode (spec.rewrite) + mode-exclusion CEL\n\nAdds RewriteSpec (targetRef KDexPage|KDexFunction, bounded path template,\ncanonical) for kdex-tech/host-manager#217, and folds in #201: a text page\nmay not set patternPath, and the BasePath/PatternPath doc comments no\nlonger describe the retired /{l10n} wildcard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bce810b211b6a7aa1352164846cb98f0ca2290f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/4bce810b211b6a7aa1352164846cb98f0ca2290f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/66c821de2daa4885265bda9c5ef5dc8191deea43","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bce810b211b6a7aa1352164846cb98f0ca2290f\nparent 3f99767958ac7f3864d47fba3bb232ee64e041de\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1790706088 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1790706088 -0400\n\nfeat: KDexPage rewrite mode (spec.rewrite) + mode-exclusion CEL\n\nAdds RewriteSpec (targetRef KDexPage|KDexFunction, bounded path template,\ncanonical) for kdex-tech/host-manager#217, and folds in #201: a text page\nmay not set patternPath, and the BasePath/PatternPath doc comments no\nlonger describe the retired /{l10n} wildcard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHIey+nYijT8R/+K+V2sW49sdtb6hBQIR4VIPWLwXVaVYbsl9vP+dzZEyfy+9lQ1yc\nL8ngK05xdvr9CdBMWBngY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T18:34:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","follow