wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/8e62409f8e931fa79a3baa628b7acb15d7e760d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:32:38Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:32:38Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"render: add PageEntry.Tags to expose page tags in navigation templates\n\nNavigation templates receive one render.PageEntry per menu item, but a page''s\nspec.tags were never projected onto it — so a nav template could not render\ntag-driven badges, groupings, tooltips, or external links (the only free-form\nstring available was icon).\n\nAdd a render-local PageTag type (mirroring api/v1alpha1.Tag''s fields rather\nthan importing that type, to preserve the render package''s zero-dependency\nboundary on the API types) and a PageEntry.Tags field. Additive and omitempty,\nso rendered output is byte-identical for pages with no tags.\n\nhost-manager''s navigation builder populates it from spec.tags.\n\nRefs #24\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27df383a97d97cda340d7494c295d556a17ea5e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/27df383a97d97cda340d7494c295d556a17ea5e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/8e62409f8e931fa79a3baa628b7acb15d7e760d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 27df383a97d97cda340d7494c295d556a17ea5e2\nparent 02dc3c39cda0e037341c69634abda5bbbc33ea19\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1789147958 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1789147958 -0400\n\nrender: add PageEntry.Tags to expose page tags in navigation templates\n\nNavigation templates receive one render.PageEntry per menu item, but a page''s\nspec.tags were never projected onto it — so a nav template could not render\ntag-driven badges, groupings, tooltips, or external links (the only free-form\nstring available was icon).\n\nAdd a render-local PageTag type (mirroring api/v1alpha1.Tag''s fields rather\nthan importing that type, to preserve the render package''s zero-dependency\nboundary on the API types) and a PageEntry.Tags field. Additive and omitempty,\nso rendered output is byte-identical for pages with no tags.\n\nhost-manager''s navigation builder populates it from spec.tags.\n\nRefs #24\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGshVBYKrbAE3tb4KTifPfhicADC2xygmhAfeNFzujD/crffqJMvRzFB+AUMvIbCdY\n3+vqJBtTLCYEJgh7HTwAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T17:32:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organi