ech/kdex-crds/commit/eb1db3c1d9cf8f0a1685044225b692c1e046df51","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGViMWRiM2MxZDljZjhmMGExNjg1MDQ0MjI1YjY5MmMxZTA0NmRmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/26051e10625ab9a49374d2031d6bc0fdbb6b3f8d","sha":"26051e10625ab9a49374d2031d6bc0fdbb6b3f8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/26051e10625ab9a49374d2031d6bc0fdbb6b3f8d"}],"sha":"eb1db3c1d9cf8f0a1685044225b692c1e046df51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/eb1db3c1d9cf8f0a1685044225b692c1e046df51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/26051e10625ab9a49374d2031d6bc0fdbb6b3f8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T01:37:28Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T01:37:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(kdexrole): bound PolicyRule fields so the CEL passes the cost estimator (#17)\n\nThe v0.14.232 CRD fails to install on any cluster: the apiserver CEL cost\nestimator rejects PolicyRule''s four rule-level validations because the array\nfields (resources/verbs/resourceNames/scopes) and their string items were\nunbounded, so it assumes worst-case. `scopes.all(s, !s.contains('':''))` alone\nwas >100x over budget.\n\nAdd MaxItems=64 to each array + Rules, and items:MaxLength=253 on each string\nslice. Generous vs real usage; the CRD now installs. Verified via host-manager\nenvtest (BeforeSuite installs the CRD; the KDexRole CEL characterization specs\npass). Surfaced by the Task 4 integration test — the Go-decode Task 1 review\ncould not catch an apiserver-side cost failure.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5ce5229a26220116e7306cd8a6eb8fb37f476a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/c5ce5229a26220116e7306cd8a6eb8fb37f476a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/26051e10625ab9a49374d2031d6bc0fdbb6b3f8d","verification":{"payload":"tree c5ce5229a26220116e7306cd8a6eb8fb37f476a1\nparent 2632fbd72278f131aed7a0cf1bd86f8fca1172f5\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1784425048 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784425048 -0400\n\nfix(kdexrole): bound PolicyRule fields so the CEL passes the cost estimator (#17)\n\nThe v0.14.232 CRD fails to install on any cluster: the apiserver CEL cost\nestimator rejects PolicyRule''s four rule-level validations because the array\nfields (resources/verbs/resourceNames/scopes) and their string items were\nunbounded, so it assumes worst-case. `scopes.all(s, !s.contains('':''))` alone\nwas >100x over budget.\n\nAdd MaxItems=64 to each array + Rules, and items:MaxLength=253 on each string\nslice. Generous vs real usage; the CRD now installs. Verified via host-manager\nenvtest (BeforeSuite installs the CRD; the KDexRole CEL characterization specs\npass). Surfaced by the Task 4 integration test — the Go-decode Task 1 review\ncould not catch an apiserver-side cost failure.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXCpYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3nIQABqCVN4N1TcPYSVYZHE6qQL7\nFIUIIz5LprMUvZgA6UweUIEZcsLZl+SYYgjCgFZ7+z8k97KHDIRojdav+3gmd7rz\nefaHU27k7HLZC7XBS5b9xNyLBMCWo2Sic0eDfbNX7a13g9wMU3nf9wW+wy+sPxYL\nfA2qM8an1axtI7LIZNjMddzW27OmBa/gULHglHiTIW2XL5+c0x/AWBNE3uGAoSwC\nv6UWDQ5WQk9JgLV0OvQ6eR9QZuFv3tMhUWjW5CQQ56isHb3AVtOD2jX4RbD8aBdU\nnreaZa567zQLriFQxqXnI2jsFcjjyPtRj1GZQt56wp2/Vcl3IjR+TeTxCECAiBhw\nJ8oQ/FCfjpg68fOCnGwQVkMOVy3JMWq1XfZPmarvj+Bs/IkKZJrOuIL8tGv5M7eP\nej0yU+ejT7rd78T+ukU8/Q7qD7Nsed+q7bQqcKjGSvt+2IzVEQUsHMpBKrH/EZBB\n2T28VZ35ZT3W3Y9UfSn3rUm4IT7r1EXIQ5Zx96X/41rvs8FEd59qnxFKuodR8WoC\n0S5H4NdHOvv9eKu8JDmMsYIzwSJ/j+sC2LBZO8YsbimwLM8LIQMeRVosXVFgsR5I\nog0EcDQQTUiyFzUmM6aeUCS0XsXWHq45aoWqYdg9KRHHArXY06QV+KgVLdGSPk0I\n6TsJDL5LsIg91CFnD3CQ\n=tZdg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-19T01:37:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kde