epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/b7c592b45445799bf882ccdd98498651623f3f53","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGI3YzU5MmI0NTQ0NTc5OWJmODgyY2NkZDk4NDk4NjUxNjIzZjNmNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4","sha":"695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4"}],"sha":"b7c592b45445799bf882ccdd98498651623f3f53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/b7c592b45445799bf882ccdd98498651623f3f53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T01:57:39Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T01:57:39Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"configuration + Observer: cluster-default registry creds, host-manager chart values, observer pod placement\n\n- NexusConfiguration: add optional DefaultImageSecretRef / DefaultNpmSecretRef\n  (*KDexObjectReference) so the consuming operator can apply a cluster-default\n  credential as a fallback for the default registries (#11).\n- Chart: add optional Values (*runtime.RawExtension) channel for cluster-wide\n  top-level host-manager chart defaults, merged UNDER per-host values (#12).\n- Observer: add optional NodeSelector / Tolerations to steer observer CronJob\n  pods to a specific node pool (#13).\n\nAdditive, backward-compatible. Regenerated deepcopy, CRD manifests, and docs;\nadded TestLoadConfiguration round-trip cases for the new config fields.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3fa767be80779e5a5b7bcba29c5a0f26d38054e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/a3fa767be80779e5a5b7bcba29c5a0f26d38054e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4","verification":{"payload":"tree a3fa767be80779e5a5b7bcba29c5a0f26d38054e\nparent 5aa1e2f19f653f99c6261b82dd9d1b695131f2a6\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1781143059 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1781143059 -0400\n\nconfiguration + Observer: cluster-default registry creds, host-manager chart values, observer pod placement\n\n- NexusConfiguration: add optional DefaultImageSecretRef / DefaultNpmSecretRef\n  (*KDexObjectReference) so the consuming operator can apply a cluster-default\n  credential as a fallback for the default registries (#11).\n- Chart: add optional Values (*runtime.RawExtension) channel for cluster-wide\n  top-level host-manager chart defaults, merged UNDER per-host values (#12).\n- Observer: add optional NodeSelector / Tolerations to steer observer CronJob\n  pods to a specific node pool (#13).\n\nAdditive, backward-compatible. Regenerated deepcopy, CRD manifests, and docs;\nadded TestLoadConfiguration round-trip cases for the new config fields.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQATjfOOubTBMJbMyQXXuiOSTYt6cwZa2bHjEb5Sxlt+jZq5P/gJvB69w0Yesia2b7d\nOc9Qo2rrIGLFz/w/VvSAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T01:58:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/695f3e216a524781069c0ea140613272945eeac4","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKDY5NWYzZTIxNmE1MjQ3ODEwNjljMGVhMTQwNjEzMjcyOTQ1ZWVhYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/5aa1e2f19f653f99c6261b82dd9d1b695131f2a6","sha":"5aa1e2f19f653f99c6261b82dd9d1b695131f2a6","url":"https://api.github.com/re