"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/ab821e102e6f64b2fdf2d3ed8de56cc9f6d25f7e","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGFiODIxZTEwMmU2ZjY0YjJmZGYyZDNlZDhkZTU2Y2M5ZjZkMjVmN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/d3870356c8756a9346b2ff8320cd837ec184d461","sha":"d3870356c8756a9346b2ff8320cd837ec184d461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/d3870356c8756a9346b2ff8320cd837ec184d461"}],"sha":"ab821e102e6f64b2fdf2d3ed8de56cc9f6d25f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/ab821e102e6f64b2fdf2d3ed8de56cc9f6d25f7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/d3870356c8756a9346b2ff8320cd837ec184d461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:42:11Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:42:11Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"kdexfunction: add Source.Regenerate field for opt-in codegen\n\nWhen spec.origin.source.regenerate=true, the host-manager controller\nwill run the codegen Job on every reconcile even though source is\nset. This lets functions with hand-authored code opt into the\ncluster-side regen path so spec.api shape changes flow through\nfngogen/fnnodejsgen without local ''go generate'' coordination.\n\nDefault false preserves the current behavior (source is the truth,\nno codegen).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42581ff1088382e781529429547cbc8469fce02f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/42581ff1088382e781529429547cbc8469fce02f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/d3870356c8756a9346b2ff8320cd837ec184d461","verification":{"payload":"tree 42581ff1088382e781529429547cbc8469fce02f\nparent 6eeb10d9fa3713c168a8aff457dbfa1c6195c02d\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779763331 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779763331 -0400\n\nkdexfunction: add Source.Regenerate field for opt-in codegen\n\nWhen spec.origin.source.regenerate=true, the host-manager controller\nwill run the codegen Job on every reconcile even though source is\nset. This lets functions with hand-authored code opt into the\ncluster-side regen path so spec.api shape changes flow through\nfngogen/fnnodejsgen without local ''go generate'' coordination.\n\nDefault false preserves the current behavior (source is the truth,\nno codegen).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHEeN5kJUjNs5OxNQFHlBlBMH1sji0zxxxdNILuwv9LpTBoXH9vacKBPQytWlZBmH1\nB6uHC6J4PSRjq