.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"kdexfunction: design for spec.backend Service-backed mode\n\nCaptures the agreed design for a KDexFunction whose API is fronted by an\nexisting in-cluster Service (e.g. knowdb via Helm), bypassing the kpack +\nKnative build/deploy pipeline. Discriminated spec.backend.{type,service}\non the CRD, exactly-one CEL with spec.origin, EndpointSlice-aware\nreadiness in the host-manager reconciler, basePath-strip in the proxy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a2631d94bdc064ef457318ef18b4de040c34540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/7a2631d94bdc064ef457318ef18b4de040c34540"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/5cefcc463e62c7ec1612782ddc58ccfcbba16cd9","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a2631d94bdc064ef457318ef18b4de040c34540\nparent c4374d0f2e339240a1cabfc97dd989efde108bc9\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779642102 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779642102 -0400\n\nkdexfunction: design for spec.backend Service-backed mode\n\nCaptures the agreed design for a KDexFunction whose API is fronted by an\nexisting in-cluster Service (e.g. knowdb via Helm), bypassing the kpack +\nKnative build/deploy pipeline. Discriminated spec.backend.{type,service}\non the CRD, exactly-one CEL with spec.origin, EndpointSlice-aware\nreadiness in the host-manager reconciler, basePath-strip in the proxy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDGgdn45ZkKZqPxB7f+tNAPWFROCJmjTx2wJcXeCxv99PHwxujvxeXnPiXqJKf9zB7\nHLadEqYgRxcQvaXA9LkAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T17:50:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser