short, RFC3339\nfallback) are all locale-neutral. Rename to _ to silence; expand the\ndocstring noting the param stays for signature symmetry + future CLDR\ndate pattern support.\n\nFollow-up to v0.14.214 (which failed CI on this rule).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLJ3NCnu1gP/vWdW3cXkkTnRKOCYBEY7E/nD2H5eRCnr4+O9OgJpsP+NXVpm8QPhDT\n1C3xPraseVdXxIr0zVVA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T16:04:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/c4374d0f2e339240a1cabfc97dd989efde108bc9","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGM0Mzc0ZDBmMmUzMzkyNDBhMWNhYmZjOTdkZDk4OWVmZGUxMDhiYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995","sha":"a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995"}],"sha":"c4374d0f2e339240a1cabfc97dd989efde108bc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/c4374d0f2e339240a1cabfc97dd989efde108bc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:59:20Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:59:20Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"render: add locale-aware FuncMap helpers (number/currency/percent/bytes/date)\n\nNew render/format.go wraps golang.org/x/text/{number,currency,message}\nbehind unexported helpers; new FuncMap entries in render.go bind them\nto the renderer''s parsed language.Tag (closes over a per-RenderOne\nparse, mirroring how l10n closes over r.MessagePrinter).\n\nTests cover en-CA + fr-CA parity; expected strings use NBSP (U+00A0)\nwhere x/text emits it. formatCurrency expectations diverge from the\nplan because x/text emits \"US$ 15.00\" / \"$ US 15,00\" (symbol-\nfirst in fr-CA) where JS Intl emits \"US$15.00\" / \"15,00 $ US\"; tests\nassert what x/text actually produces.\n\nScope notes:\n- formatRelative deferred (browser-only need; no server template use)\n- formatDate supports year + short only; medium/long/full deferred\n  pending decision on a gotext-style CLDR dep\n- byte-unit suffix uses a hand-rolled en/fr table; x/text/feature/unit\n  is not GA\n\nCompanion: knowdrive-site/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-23-localized-units-of-measure.md\n(Side B, Tasks B1-B3).","tree":{"sha":"26e726fbedffdcb5510246c151f484419d42f8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/26e726fbedffdcb5510246c151f484419d42f8ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995","verification":{"payload":"tree 26e726fbedffdcb5510246c151f484419d42f8ca\nparent a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779551960 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779551960 -0400\n\nrender: add locale-aware FuncMap helpers (number/currency/percent/bytes/date)\n\nNew render/format.go wraps golang.org/x/text/{number,currency,message}\nbehind unexported helpers; new FuncMap entries in render.go bind them\nto the renderer''s parsed language.Tag (closes over a per-RenderOne\nparse, mirroring how l10n closes over r.MessagePrinter).\n\nTests cover en-CA + fr-CA parity; expected strings use NBSP (U+00A0)\nwhere x/text emits it. formatCurrency expectations diverge from the\nplan because x/text emits \"US$ 15.00\" / \"$ US 15,00\" (symbol-\nfirst in fr-CA) where JS Intl emits \"US$15.00\" / \"15,00 $ US\"; tests\nassert what x/text actually produces.\n\nScope notes:\n- formatRelative deferred (browser-only need; no server template use)\n- formatDate supports year + short only; medium/long/full deferred\n  pending decision on a gotext-style CLDR dep\n- byte-unit suffix uses a hand-rolled en/fr table; x/text/feature/unit\n  is not GA\n\nCompanion: knowdrive-site/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-23-localized-units-of-measure.md\n(Side B, Tasks B1-B3).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKg+ym2u5S2dgANZbSUfp5Wz5tRcChDGbXJRjcLZxY/fSYP8SUbntG/Yutvi92/gEJ\nwbnpZF9jOQna7YAfQIowg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T16:01:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGE3MWQ2MTk0NTM3MGVmYzJhYTMyYWUxMWQzYzk5OTcxZTBjNzY5OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a","sha":"a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a"}],"sha":"a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a71d61945370efc2aa32ae11d3c99971e0c76995"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:13:21Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:13:21Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"Deployer + KDexFunctionSpec: runtime-pod Tolerations + NodeSelector\n\nCompanion to v0.14.212''s Builder.{Tolerations,NodeSelector,Resources}\nwhich control kpack BUILD pod placement: this pair controls the\nKnative Service RUNTIME pod placement (closes #7).\n\nFaaSAdaptor.Deployer gains Tolerations + NodeSelector as cluster-wide\ndefaults applied to every function deployed via this FaaSAdaptor.\nKDexFunctionSpec gains the same two fields with REPLACE semantics\nfor per-function overrides: when set on the function CR they replace\nthe Deployer defaults; when unset the Deployer defaults apply; when\nboth are unset no scheduling preference is emitted (prior behavior).\n\nConsumers (kdex-host-manager#23, kdex-knative-deployer#3) read these\nthrough to the Knative Service spec.template.spec.{tolerations,\nnodeSelector}, which requires the cluster to enable Knative''s\nkubernetes.podspec-tolerations + kubernetes.podspec-nodeselector\nfeature flags. The chart-side prerequisite is documented in the\nconsuming repos.\n\nCRD yaml + deepcopy + reference docs regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6eecfe35dcbed7fb1b7aa0d08ad98379846ec627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/6eecfe35dcbed7fb1b7aa0d08ad98379846ec627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6eecfe35dcbed7fb1b7aa0d08ad98379846ec627\nparent 72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779293601 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779293601 -0400\n\nDeployer + KDexFunctionSpec: runtime-pod Tolerations + NodeSelector\n\nCompanion to v0.14.212''s Builder.{Tolerations,NodeSelector,Resources}\nwhich control kpack BUILD pod placement: this pair controls the\nKnative Service RUNTIME pod placement (closes #7).\n\nFaaSAdaptor.Deployer gains Tolerations + NodeSelector as cluster-wide\ndefaults applied to every function deployed via this FaaSAdaptor.\nKDexFunctionSpec gains the same two fields with REPLACE semantics\nfor per-function overrides: when set on the function CR they replace\nthe Deployer defaults; when unset the Deployer defaults apply; when\nboth are unset no scheduling preference is emitted (prior behavior).\n\nConsumers (kdex-host-manager#23, kdex-knative-deployer#3) read these\nthrough to the Knative Service spec.template.spec.{tolerations,\nnodeSelector}, which requires the cluster to enable Knative''s\nkubernetes.podspec-tolerations + kubernetes.podspec-nodeselector\nfeature flags. The chart-side prerequisite is documented in the\nconsuming repos.\n\nCRD yaml + deepcopy + reference docs regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMR+hqgNZy7PqMR7gjEm/Jb2BVz1S3U/sWnxhFl+iwixoj/pMxrv+KiVgBzpB6fdQI\nT+EVSxvWUMrAxFL73p5QY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T16:13:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKGE2NjE5YWZiMWIzN2ZjZDQ3NWIxMDBmM2Y3YzA5MjkwZjY1NWY5NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4","sha":"72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4"}],"sha":"a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/a6619afb1b37fcd475b100f3f7c09290f655f94a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:58:10Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:58:10Z","email":"rayauge@doublebite.com","name":"Raymond Augé"},"message":"Builder + Observer: pod-scheduling fields for kpack BUILD pods + retry policy\n\nTwo paired additions, both purely additive (existing CRs unchanged):\n\nBuilder gains Tolerations, NodeSelector, Resources (closes #5). All\nthree forward onto kpack.io/Image.spec.build.{tolerations,nodeSelector,\nresources} and from there onto the per-Build Pod. Unblocks landing\nbuilds on a tainted node pool (e.g. a GKE Spot pool with the\nauto-applied cloud.google.com/gke-spot taint) and capping build-pod\nresources so compile-heavy languages don''t OOM-kill on best-effort QoS.\n\nObserver gains MaxBuildRetries + RetryCooldown (closes #4). Policy\nknobs for the kpack-Build auto-recovery shim being added to\nkdex-knative-deployer (kdex-tech/knative-deployer#1): bound the\nobserver''s retry budget and dampen storm behavior during regional\npreemption events. Defaults match the shim''s compiled-in fallbacks\n(3 retries, 4 * schedule cooldown ~20m).\n\nCRD yaml + deepcopy + reference docs regenerated via make manifests +\nmake generate + make docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4ae82ada27337c613fcead693003da8bb9fd27a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/trees/f4ae82ada27337c613fcead693003da8bb9fd27a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/git/commits/72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4","verification":{"payload":"tree f4ae82ada27337c613fcead693003da8bb9fd27a\nparent 1d2945ec0301cd2ede8d23272d6f7e188a2e59bf\nauthor Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779289090 -0400\ncommitter Raymond Augé <rayauge@doublebite.com> 1779289090 -0400\n\nBuilder + Observer: pod-scheduling fields for kpack BUILD pods + retry policy\n\nTwo paired additions, both purely additive (existing CRs unchanged):\n\nBuilder gains Tolerations, NodeSelector, Resources (closes #5). All\nthree forward onto kpack.io/Image.spec.build.{tolerations,nodeSelector,\nresources} and from there onto the per-Build Pod. Unblocks landing\nbuilds on a tainted node pool (e.g. a GKE Spot pool with the\nauto-applied cloud.google.com/gke-spot taint) and capping build-pod\nresources so compile-heavy languages don''t OOM-kill on best-effort QoS.\n\nObserver gains MaxBuildRetries + RetryCooldown (closes #4). Policy\nknobs for the kpack-Build auto-recovery shim being added to\nkdex-knative-deployer (kdex-tech/knative-deployer#1): bound the\nobserver''s retry budget and dampen storm behavior during regional\npreemption events. Defaults match the shim''s compiled-in fallbacks\n(3 retries, 4 * schedule cooldown ~20m).\n\nCRD yaml + deepcopy + reference docs regenerated via make manifests +\nmake generate + make docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkz/IkshVam7RsEHOJqfJnmZzKW\n6nB7fLHKMU+FCwWhUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNVlHebww5/+wxgspP7/k6pW7rgY3vdcv3UJCaLdLUS6gytPjbjTFjcW2HhbXbDEAQ\nfJrtKJ7si+4NQIyxRtLgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T14:58:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rotty3000","id":146764,"login":"rotty3000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Njc2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rotty3000","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/72d05df0b2c2eea850ab6bde2ba915c0eb52dcf4","node_id":"C_kwDOPv1QHtoAKDcyZDA1ZGYwYjJjMmVlYTg1MGFiNmJkZTJiYTkxNWMwZWI1MmRjZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commit/1d2945ec0301cd2ede8d23272d6f7e188a2e59bf","sha":"1d2945ec0301cd2ede8d23272d6f7e188a2e59bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdex-tech/kdex-crds/commits/1d2945ec0301cd2e