rchivos de configuración de despliegue\n- Limpieza de proyecto legacy (core/, manage.py, RepDrill/*, tests antiguos, WARP.md)\n- Eliminación de db.sqlite3 del repositorio (usar base de datos en servicios)\n- Actualizados docker-compose y nginx para nueva arquitectura\n- Mejoras de UI en frontend: nuevas páginas, componentes y servicios (analytics, reports, suppliers, etc.)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: se elimina la estructura monolítica (core/ y RepDrill/*) en favor de microservicios; actualizar scripts y pipelines en consecuencia.","tree":{"sha":"a5f441f333ec5a1917e7a4aea7d62d6631cbc5d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JorgeFreire95/Rep-Drill/git/trees/a5f441f333ec5a1917e7a4aea7d62d6631cbc5d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JorgeFreire95/Rep-Drill/git/commits/fd2a550e6ad8509b310fbfe43ba1525e28114c86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92636356?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RazorZ7X","id":92636356,"login":"RazorZ7X","node_id":"U_kgDOBYWExA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RazorZ7X","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JorgeFreire95/Rep-Drill/commit/fd2a550e6ad8509b310fbfe43ba1525e28114c86","node_id":"C_kwDOPwRDKNoAKGZkMmE1NTBlN